WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.401 --> 00:00:03.751
Unit twenty-four. A Clean Environment!

2
00:00:04.674 --> 00:00:08.461
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.511 --> 00:00:11.710
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.911
Today we learn about A Clean Environment. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.368 --> 00:00:21.335
Environment. Say it with me. Environment!

6
00:00:24.873 --> 00:00:28.240
Rubbish. Say it with me. Rubbish!

7
00:00:31.706 --> 00:00:35.289
Plastic. Say it with me. Plastic!

8
00:00:38.794 --> 00:00:42.644
Recycle. Say it with me. Recycle!

9
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.203
Burn. Say it with me. Burn!

10
00:00:52.709 --> 00:00:56.092
Smoke. Say it with me. Smoke!

11
00:00:59.574 --> 00:01:02.874
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

12
00:01:06.374 --> 00:01:10.274
Community. Say it with me. Community!

13
00:01:13.778 --> 00:01:23.215
A clean environment keeps our community healthy. We put rubbish in bins and recycle plastic. Burning plastic makes harmful smoke, so we do not burn it.

14
00:01:23.265 --> 00:01:24.515
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.682 --> 00:01:30.732
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.782 --> 00:01:31.932
Plastic!

17
00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:38.198
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.248 --> 00:01:39.398
Clean!

19
00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:44.886
Did you know? Smoke from burning plastic can hurt people's lungs!

20
00:01:44.936 --> 00:01:46.930
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.697 --> 00:01:55.880
Think and answer. How can you help keep your community clean?

22
00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:57.080
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:03.317
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:06.052
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

